they fit together beautifully like you would see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:59.820
on a pavement or a wall - no gaps and no overlaps. So&nbsp;
those are the the two main rules: they fit together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:05.160
no gaps, no overlaps. So every single triangle&nbsp;
